	(text "Host connectors: J2 (male) plugs into the 128D's female keyboard socket, on its right side; J3 (female) takes\nthe keyboard's cable.  Every pin runs straight through, so a wired keyboard works as normal, and the\nCH446Q and the FETs sit on the same lines in parallel.  Both are solder-cup DB25s straddling 1.6 mm board edges."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.39 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "257dc857-a3ee-523b-b978-affdf415dd91")
	)
